sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Operator
    participant SPA as Blazor WASM SPA<br/>Home.razor / Arena.razor
    participant MW as Middleware pipeline
    participant EP as DuelsEndpoints<br/>MapGroup /api/duels
    participant CMD as CommenceDuelHandler
    participant Q as BackgroundTaskQueue
    participant EXEC as DuelExecutionService
    participant FP as FoundryInferenceProxy
    participant WW as webllm-worker.js<br/>(WebGPU)
    participant HUB as DuelHub<br/>/hubs/duel
    participant TS as Table Storage
    participant BS as Blob Storage
    participant AJ as AutoJudge
    participant FJ as FoundryDuelJudge
    participant RV as RecordVerdictHandler

    rect rgb(238, 242, 255)
    Note over U,MW: 1 — Submit
    U->>SPA: choose left + right model, pick prompt
    SPA->>MW: POST /api/duels {LeftModelId, RightModelId, PromptText, AutoJudgeDelaySeconds?}<br/>Cookie: PoLocalCompare.Session · X-Correlation-ID
    MW->>MW: Serilog request log → ExceptionHandler → CSP → Routing → AuthN → AuthZ
    alt no valid cookie and Features:AllowAnonymousWrites = false
        MW-->>SPA: 401 (OnRedirectToLogin rewritten — never a 302 to HTML)
        SPA->>U: render Login.razor
    end
    MW->>EP: route matched (FallbackPolicy satisfied)
    EP->>EP: validate PromptText, clamp AutoJudgeDelaySeconds to 0..3600
    EP->>CMD: CommenceDuelCommand(+ actor from preferred_username)
    CMD->>TS: insert Duel — PK yyyyMM, RK ULID, Verdict = Pending
    EP->>Q: DuelExecutionService.EnqueueAsync(duelId)
    EP-->>SPA: 202 Accepted + DuelDto
    SPA->>SPA: NavigateTo /arena/{duelId}
    SPA->>HUB: JoinDuel(duelId) → group duel:{id}
    end

    rect rgb(236, 253, 245)
    Note over Q,BS: 2 — Asymmetric execution (900 s watchdog, Task.WhenAll)
    Q->>EXEC: dequeue, new DI scope
    EXEC->>TS: load Duel + both Models
    EXEC->>HUB: lobby DuelStarted
    par Server-side path (Remote / Ollama)
        EXEC->>HUB: ModelStatusUpdate(Initializing → Generating)
        EXEC->>FP: RunInferenceAsync(model, promptFull, onTokenUpdate, ct)
        FP->>FP: POST /openai/deployments/{d}/chat/completions?api-version=2024-12-01-preview<br/>stream_options.include_usage only when SupportsStreamUsage(deployment)
        alt HTTP 404 on deployment route
            FP->>FP: retry POST /models/chat/completions (model field in body)
        else HTTP 429 / 503 / 502
            FP->>FP: up to 3 attempts, Retry-After honoured (clamped 1–90 s)
        end
        loop every SSE chunk
            FP-->>EXEC: token, elapsedMs, HtmlStreamStats (preview every 25 tokens)
            EXEC->>HUB: ModelStatusUpdate(tokens, velocity, warmUp, stalled)
        end
        FP->>FP: ApiCostUsd = prompt/1e6 × inPrice + output/1e6 × outPrice
    and Client-side path (Local / WebLLM)
        EXEC->>HUB: StartLocalInference {duelId, modelId, side, webLlmModelId}
        HUB-->>SPA: OnStartLocalInference (Arena.razor)
        SPA->>WW: postMessage — load weights, generate
        WW-->>SPA: streamed tokens
        SPA->>EP: POST /api/duels/{id}/local-result (AllowAnonymous)
        EP->>TS: HtmlOutputNormalizer + DuelResultEnricher → save DuelResult
        loop every 500 ms until row appears
            EXEC->>TS: poll DuelResults(duelId, modelId)
        end
        Note right of EXEC: StartLocalInference is re-sent every 5 s<br/>for late-joining clients
    end
    EXEC->>HUB: ModelStatusUpdate(Done, finalHtml ≤ 40 000 chars)
    EXEC->>TS: DuelResultEnricher (density, quality, GreenStats) → save
    alt output over 64 KB
        EXEC->>BS: upload duel-html-outputs/{duelId}/{modelId}.html
        EXEC->>TS: store "blob://…" pointer instead of the body
    end
    EXEC->>TS: Duel.CompletedAt (412 → re-read + reapply, never clobber a verdict)
    EXEC->>HUB: DuelComplete
    end

    rect rgb(255, 251, 235)
    Note over U,RV: 3 — Verdict (human first, then auto-judge)
    EXEC->>AJ: RunAsync(duelId, delayOverride)
    AJ->>AJ: await AiJudge:DelaySeconds (clamped 0–3600)
    alt Human picked inside the window
        U->>EP: POST /api/duels/{id}/verdict {Verdict}
        EP->>RV: RecordVerdictCommand(VerdictSource.Human, actor)
        AJ->>TS: re-read duel — Verdict != Pending → stand down
    else Still Pending after the window
        AJ->>TS: load both DuelResults
        alt both sides failed
            AJ->>TS: persist JudgeStoodDownReason — stays Pending, no ELO
        else exactly one side failed
            AJ->>RV: walkover — survivor wins, no judge call (PRD item 20)
        else both produced output
            AJ->>FJ: JudgeAsync(promptFull, left, right)
            FJ->>FJ: coin-flip A/B slots, delimiter-fenced untrusted docs,<br/>response_format json_schema {winner: A|B|Tie, reason}
            alt HTTP 429
                FJ-->>AJ: JudgeRateLimitedException(Retry-After)
                AJ->>Q: requeue (max AiJudge:RateLimitRetryMax attempts)
            else unparseable / timeout / not configured
                FJ-->>AJ: null → duel stays Pending
            else decided
                FJ-->>AJ: JudgeDecision(Left | Right | Tie, reason)
                AJ->>RV: RecordVerdictCommand(VerdictSource.Ai, rationale, deployment)
            end
        end
    end
    RV->>TS: first write wins — second throws InvalidOperationException → 409
    RV->>TS: EloCalculator K=32 → update both Models + append EloHistory
    RV->>RV: HybridCache tag-invalidate "leaderboard"
    RV->>HUB: VerdictRecorded + lobby event
    HUB-->>SPA: render winner, Elo deltas, judge rationale
    end
